# Translation draft; not reviewed by a native speaker.
photo_merge_advanced.projective = 透视对齐（包括旋转）
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = 柱面全景
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = 消除移动主体的重影（以第一张照片为参考）
